  <item>
    <title>36 我以为出国会告诉我答案【全英】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a85486b8156bf33621aaeeb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a85486b8156bf33621aaeeb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 06:23:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>This episode is a little different from my usual ones.</span></p><p><span>I put together a few voice recordings I made at different points during my time abroad:</span></p><p><span>📍 Day 7 in Melbourne</span><br><span>📍 Day 20 in Melbourne</span><br><span>📍 Tekapo, New Zealand — when I decided to stay in Australia</span></p><p><span>At each of these moments, I was trying to figure out the same thing:</span></p><p><strong><span>What do I actually want from this life abroad?</span></strong></p><p><span>When I recorded these conversations, I had no idea where the story would eventually lead me. I didn’t know what decision I would make, or how much my thoughts would change in just a few weeks.</span></p><p><span>Listening back to them now, I realized how different I sounded at each stage.</span></p><p><span>So I decided to put them all together as a little time capsule — a record of what was going on in my head at those different moments.</span></p><p><span>Also, because these recordings were made in different places and environments, the audio quality isn’t exactly consistent. Sometimes the volume might be a little louder or quieter, and you might hear some background noise too </span></p><p><span>Please bear with me, and I hope you enjoy this little piece of my journey XOXO</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643aafd8675c7d8caa331fc3/lne_5WT_xMHQo9LcQA5LBaBLteu1.m4a" length="36097226" type="audio/mp4"/>
