    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Dear friends,</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Life is all about meeting and parting, but somehow, I still haven’t learned how to say goodbye.</span></p><span></span><p><span>This episode comes from my time in Dali — when my volunteering journey was coming to an end, and I started thinking about how every encounter feels like a short summer camp: fleeting, but full of meaning.</span></p><span></span><p><span>With love,</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>Leah</span></strong></p>]]></description>
